    "629d2619d7a83b1c51598c63e80964e18d6dfc28ff7e49757a7be4a662720037": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "a2df51134a4b69a3bc2b4c8bd217f295f40496aacee36bc1376ca1822c6356f3",
      "contextFingerprint": "1e4360c606a9cd10ec0dfa3dad5739a170ffe28e24f23f76808d9a7c7e0918f0",
      "sourceText": "所以RViz箭头若被你理解成底盘车头，而当前云台相对底盘左转90°，就可能少算一个云台角。位置也对应云台原点：若人工消息给z=0，源码把它当作云台原点位于map的z=0，而不是“底盘地面高度为0”；高度应按这份地图的基准核对。只改 `robot_base_frame` 的名字也需要重新核对整条关系，不能把“机器人”三个字自动等同于底盘。本参数仅该回调用，不在每次点云匹配时扣机械角。",
      "translatedText": "Therefore, if you interpret the RViz arrow as the chassis front, while the current gimbal is turned 90° left relative to the chassis, you may miss a gimbal angle\\. The position also corresponds to the gimbal origin: if the manual message gives z=0, the source code treats it as the gimbal origin being at z=0 in the map, not as \"the chassis ground height being 0\"; the height should be checked against this map's datum\\. Changing only the name of `robot_base_frame` also requires rechecking the entire relationship; the three characters \"robot\" cannot automatically be equated with the chassis\\. This parameter is only used in this callback and is not deducted as a mechanical angle during each point cloud matching\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 243,
        "outputTokens": 161,
        "costUsd": 0.000267
      }
    },
